---
description: Rails 8 conventions for the sample todo app
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow standard Rails 8 convensions
Use the rails generators for new models, controllers, migrations, etc 
keep the controllers thin 
use html and JSON
keep the shared view particals close to the relevant existing views 
don't add in line java/erb 
keep migrations reversible and use migrations to change schema don't change the root schema itself. 
don't add new gems unless requested
